u0308ru\u0308mchi", "identifiers": {}, "covers": [7497891], "publish_date": "2000", "key": "/books/OL25978277M", "works": [{"key": "/works/OL1879848W"}], "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "isbn_13": ["9780393320190"], "classifications": {}, "source_records": ["bwb:9780393320190", "ia:mummiesofurumchi0000barb", "promise:bwb_daily_pallets_2022-03-17", "promise:bwb_daily_pallets_2021-05-21"], "ocaid": "mummiesofurumchi0000barb", "lc_classifications": ["GN778.32.C5 B37 2000"], "local_id": ["urn:bwbsku:O7-BPO-726", "urn:bwbsku:P7-BKL-597"], "latest_revision": 8, "revision": 8, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2016-10-14T03:30:10.869509"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2023-01-14T18:56:30.465093"}}}, "OLID:OL358977M": {"bib_key": "OLID:OL358977M", "info_url": "http://openlibrary.org/books/OL358977M/The_mummies_of_U\u0308ru\u0308mchi", "preview": "borrow", "preview_url": "https://archive.org/details/mummiesofurumchi00barb", "thumbnail_url": "https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/10708239-S.jpg", "details": {"publishers": ["W.W. Norton & Company"], "number_of_pages": 240, "isbn_10": ["0393045218"], "subject_place": ["Tarim Basin (China)", "Xinjiang Uygur Zizhiqu (China)", "China", "Xinjiang Uygur Zizhiqu."], "covers": [10708239], "lc_classifications": ["GN778.32.C5 B37 1999", "GN778.32.C5B37 1999"], "key": "/books/OL358977M", "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL225040A", "name": "E. J. W. Barber"}], "ocaid": "mummiesofurumchi00barb", "publish_places": ["New York"], "subjects": ["Mummies -- China -- Xinjiang Uygur Zizhiqu", "Bronze age -- China -- Xinjiang Uygur Zizhiqu", "Textile fabrics, Prehistoric -- China -- Xinjiang Uygur Zizhiqu", "Tarim Basin (China) -- Antiquities", "Xinjiang Uygur Zizhiqu (China) -- Antiquities"], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "pagination": "240 p. :", "source_records": ["marc:marc_records_scriblio_net/part27.dat:71348224:937", "marc:marc_ithaca_college/ic_marc.mrc:170908957:1315", "ia:mummiesofurumchi00barb", "marc:marc_openlibraries_sanfranciscopubliclibrary/sfpl_chq_2018_12_24_run02.mrc:175850105:2227", "bwb:9780393045215", "marc:marc_loc_2016/BooksAll.2016.part27.utf8:14144213:939", "promise:bwb_daily_pallets_2023-11-03:O9-BIE-136", "marc:marc_columbia/Columbia-extract-20221130-005.mrc:306754509:3126", "marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/20220215_031.bib.mrc:206512641:2634"], "title": "The mummies of U\u0308ru\u0308mchi", "dewey_decimal_class": ["393/.3"], "notes": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "Includes bibliographical references and index."}, "identifiers": {"goodreads": ["1357556"], "librarything": ["147622"]}, "edition_name": "1st ed.", "lccn": ["98018958"], "local_id": ["urn:sfpl:31223053668241", "urn:sfpl:31223054026266", "urn:sfpl:31223054026274", "urn:sfpl:31223053668274", "urn:bwbsku:O9-BIE-136"], "publish_date": "1999", "publish_country": "nyu", "by_statement": "Elizabeth Wayland Barber.", "works": [{"key": "/works/OL1879848W"}], "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "oclc_numbers": ["39093534"], "description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "In the museums of Urumchi, the wind-swept regional capital of the Uyghur Autonomous Region in Western China, a collection of ancient mummies date back as far as 4,000 years - contemporary to the famous Egyptian mummies, but even more beautifully preserved, especially their clothing. Surprisingly, these prehistoric people are not Asian but Caucasoid - tall and large-nosed and blond with thick beards and round eyes (probably blue). What were these blond Caucasians doing in the heart of Asia?\n\nWhere did they come from and what language did they speak? Might they be related to a \"lost tribe\" of Indo-Europeans known from later inscriptions? Few gifts are to be found in the graves of Urumchi, making it difficult for archaeologists to pinpoint cultural connections from clues offered by pottery and tools. But their clothes - woolens that rarely survive more than a few centurieshave been preserved as brightly hued as the day they were woven.\n\nElizabeth Wayland Barber describes these remarkable mummies, their clothing, their sheepherding ways, and their path to this remote, mysterious, and forbidding place. She pieces together their history and peculiar Western connections from both what she saw in Urumchi and the testimony of explorers who traveled along the Silk Road a century earlier."}, "latest_revision": 18, "revision": 18, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2008-04-01T03:28:50.625462"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2026-02-19T21:54:30.330647"}}}, "OLID:OL45773711M": {"bib_key": "OLID:OL45773711M", "info_url": "http://openlibrary.org/books/OL45773711M/The_Mummies_of_Urumchi", "preview": "noview", "preview_url": "http://openlibrary.org/books/OL45773711M/The_Mummies_of_Urumchi", "details": {"type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL3078690A", "name": "Elizabeth Barber"}], "isbn_10": ["0965684067"], "isbn_13": ["9780965684064"], "local_id": ["urn:bwbsku:W3-BMP-339"], "publish_date": "1999-01-01", "publishers": ["W.W. Norton"], "source_records": ["promise:bwb_daily_pallets_2021-08-19"], "title": "The Mummies of Urumchi", "full_title": "The Mummies of Urumchi", "works": [{"key": "/works/OL33800565W"}], "key": "/books/OL45773711M", "latest_revision": 1, "revision": 1, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2023-01-14T14:57:02.764634"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2023-01-14T14:57:02.764634"}}}, "OLID:OL33800259M": {"bib_key": "OLID:OL33800259M", "info_url": "http://openlibrary.org/books/OL33800259M/Scoff", "preview": "noview", "preview_url": "http://openlibrary.org/books/OL33800259M/Scoff", "details": {"type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL7528810A", "name": "Pen Vogler"}], "isbn_13": ["9781786496485"], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "publish_date": "2020", "publishers": ["Atlantic Books, Limited"], "source_records": ["bwb:9781786496485"], "title": "Scoff", "subtitle": "A History of Food and Class in Britain", "full_title": "Scoff A History of Food and Class in Britain", "works": [{"key": "/works/OL22157747W"}], "key": "/books/OL33800259M", "latest_revision": 1, "revision": 1, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2021-09-21T18:37:14.553208"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2021-09-21T18:37:14.553208"}}}, "OLID:OL33946189M": {"bib_key": "OLID:OL33946189M", "info_url": "http://openlibrary.org/books/OL33946189M/Scoff", "preview": "noview", "preview_url": "http://openlibrary.org/books/OL33946189M/Scoff", "details": {"type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL7528810A", "name": "Pen Vogler"}], "isbn_13": ["9781786496492"], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "lc_classifications": ["GT2853"], "number_of_pages": 480, "publish_date": "2021", "publishers": ["Atlantic Books, Limited"], "source_records": ["bwb:9781786496492", "promise:bwb_daily_pallets_2022-05-23"], "subjects": ["Manners and customs"], "title": "Scoff", "subtitle": "A History of Food and Class in Britain", "full_title": "Scoff A History of Food and Class in Britain", "works": [{"key": "/works/OL22157747W"}], "key": "/books/OL33946189M", "local_id": ["urn:bwbsku:KQ-864-002"], "latest_revision": 2, "revision": 2, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2021-09-28T14:21:36.717742"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2022-12-05T08:18:55.432283"}}}, "OLID:OL30191122M": {"bib_key": "OLID:OL30191122M", "info_url": "http://openlibrary.org/books/OL30191122M/Scoff", "preview": "noview", "preview_url": "http://openlibrary.org/books/OL30191122M/Scoff", "details": {"publishers": ["Atlantic Books, Limited"], "subtitle": "A History of Food and Class in Britain", "source_records": ["bwb:9781786496478", "promise:bwb_daily_pallets_2022-03-17", "marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/20220215_033.bib.mrc:196703373:3036"], "title": "Scoff", "number_of_pages": 480, "isbn_13": ["9781786496478"], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "lc_classifications": ["GT2853", "GT2853.G7 V64 2020"], "publish_date": "2020", "key": "/books/OL30191122M", "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL7528810A", "name": "Pen Vogler"}], "works": [{"key": "/works/OL22157747W"}], "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "subjects": ["Manners and customs"], "local_id": ["urn:bwbsku:KP-416-480"], "oclc_numbers": ["1151800073"], "description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "Avocado or beans on toast? Gin or claret? Nut roast or game pie? Milk in first or milk in last? And do you have tea, dinner or supper in the evening? In this fascinating social history of food in Britain, Pen Vogler examines the origins of our eating habits and reveals how they are loaded with centuries of class prejudice. Covering such topics as fish and chips, roast beef, avocados, tripe, fish knives and the surprising origins of breakfast, Scoff reveals how in Britain we have become experts at using eating habits to make judgements about social background. Bringing together evidence from cookbooks, literature, artworks and social records from 1066 to the present, Vogler traces the changing fortunes of the food we encounter today, and unpicks the aspirations and prejudices of the people who have shaped our cuisine for better or worse."}, "latest_revision": 3, "revision": 3, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2020-09-16T10:11:20.485630"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2026-03-25T13:24:13.594940"}}}, "OLID:OL26825887M": {"bib_key": "OLID:OL26825887M", "info_url": "http://openlibrary.org/books/OL26825887M/David_Bowie_Made_Me_Gay_100_Years_of_LGBT_Music", "preview": "noview", "preview_url": "http://openlibrary.org/books/OL26825887M/David_Bowie_Made_Me_Gay_100_Years_of_LGBT_Music", "thumbnail_url": "https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/8496310-S.jpg", "details": {"publishers": ["Overlook Press"], "source_records": ["amazon:0715651927", "marc:marc_openlibraries_sanfranciscopubliclib